[{"title":"赠画鱼贾兄","author":"陈俞","text":"春江浩荡春江阔，夜半湖声涌新沫。\n晓风吹断碧云根，万顷沧波带晴豁。\n浪花潋滟翻红桃，群鱼出没乘轻涛。\n悠扬得意鼓鳞鬣，十十五五同为曹。\n昔曾观澜知此意，真乐胸中渺无际。\n常嗟物理难形容，幸有贾君得精艺。\n巨鱼奋迅凌江湖，纤鳞错杂依菰蒲。\n精神万状幻新笔，巧与造化论锱铢。\n朅来过我示奇作，数幅生绡图纵壑。\n呼童展向虚堂中，恍若当年见鱼乐。\n如君画思几通神，眼高世俗空无人。\n石台去后今几载，毫端彷佛留芳尘。\n又宜学取洞清拔，写龙不写潜波鲔。\n徒能画鱼不画龙，空使馋夫吐馋水。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17951,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"它山堰","author":"陈坰","text":"堰雷推动阿香车，惠泽均沾十万家。\n谁任长官身后责，回潮今又见回沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17952,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"陈垓","text":"砚乾笔秃墨糊涂，半夜敲门送省符。\n掷得么么监岳庙，恰如输了选官图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17953,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀古堂和陈梦斗诗","author":"陈垲","text":"蛾眉亭下路，舟楫几经过。\n晚识黄山面，新添白发多。\n学仙徒化鹤，病偻喜名驼。\n四上江湖请，金章许换蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17954,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"极目亭","author":"陈垲","text":"谁知极目名亭意，不在登临与品题。\n天地两间同汗漫，江淮一水自东西。\n惊栖何日能归雁，灵异当年任照犀。\n万境尽从心上化，静参飞跃悟端倪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17955,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出郊观稼","author":"陈垲","text":"数月两出郊，劝农复观稼。\n始言麦垄春，今已稻畦夏。\n女红綵纴馀，丁黄耘耔暇。\n暄凉虽不齐，晴雨倏忽乍。\n百丰未为多，一歉诚所怕。\n蠲逋广上恩，平粜裁米价。\n毫发可及民，岂不念夙夜。\n昔有王长官，筑堰它山下。\n惠利久益博，神灵此其舍。\n泓深或龙蛰，坚屹无蚁罅。\n定为三七分，酾为数十汊。\n石梁贯云涛，谁敢著足跨。\n流沙从何来，疑有物驱驾。\n人力几淘浚，壅淤仍障坝。\n旦功终此惠，去沙而变化。\n视古谁比方，郑白其流亚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17956,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 循视江兴水备舟中赋","author":"陈垲","text":"万里长江，天与限、东南吴楚。\n何人者，提英□□，指鞭欲渡。\n孟德舳舻烟赤壁，佛狸心胆寒瓜步。\n问波涛、说尽几英雄，今犹古。\n中原地，纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17957,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丹台井","author":"陈奕","text":"东城有观号丹台，石甃渊然天所开。\n回客题诗今不见，空令屐齿印苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17958,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠萧韡","author":"陈峤","text":"一寸功名心已灰，翩然解组赋归来。\n中兴天子登耆旧，二十馀年挽不回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17959,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题公署","author":"陈峤","text":"当默任言言是垢，当言任默默为尘。\n当默当言俱无任，尘埃何由得到身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17960,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏作","author":"陈彦才","text":"赋命安能比钜公，偶然年月与时同。\n只因日上争些子，笑向连江作醉翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17961,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈彦敏","text":"方离岭海逾千里，才出潇湘第一州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17962,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春","author":"陈彦章妻","text":"记得爷爷，说与奴奴，陈郎俊哉。\n笑世人无眼，老夫得法，官人易聘，国土难媒。\n印信乘龙，夤绿叶凤，选似扬鞭选得来。\n果然是，西雍人物，京样官坯。\n郑郎上马三杯。\n莫把离愁恼别怀。\n那孤灯只砚，郎君珍重，离愁别恨，奴自推排。\n白发夫妻，青衫事业，两句微吟当折梅。\n彦章去，早归则个，免待相催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17963,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到九锁陆永仲出迎次韵二绝 其一","author":"陈律","text":"失身名利易沉浮，晚悟真筌盍退休。\n咫尺洞天无间阻，百岩芝蕨为吾留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17964,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"到九锁陆永仲出迎次韵二绝 其二","author":"陈律","text":"老木阴阴拥涧深，九山锁锁问知音。\n白云仙侣藏云窦，先与好风吹醉吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17965,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄山中","author":"陈律","text":"白日黄尘客路迷，偶寻幽事入烟扉。\n云行翠岫鹤争舞，月落青林人未归。\n自喜身心无世系，愿从岩谷谢朝衣。\n祥光洞口仙题在，读罢令人悟昨非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17966,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题西门亭","author":"陈律","text":"吾家四正峰前住，射策君门亦快哉。\n三岛路从天外去，一枝香折月中来。\n鲤鱼晴跃桃花浪，鹦鹉春倾竹叶杯。\n预宴琼林非所望，偶先英俊步金台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17967,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子规","author":"陈恬","text":"暮春春已晚，不见子规飞。\n莫是无归处，山禽不劝归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17968,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄晁以道求嵩山长松","author":"陈恬","text":"松上花兮松下根，食之年貌与松邻。\n君今既是松间客，采送衰翁亦可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17969,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望天台山二绝 其一","author":"陈恬","text":"嵩阳不得到，华顶可徘徊。\n当知吾性分，自有一天台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17970,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望天台山二绝 其二","author":"陈恬","text":"气骤烟云速，风飞山岳摧。\n神游八极表，何必访天台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17971,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢葛汝州宁卿遗公库酒肉薪米","author":"陈恬","text":"不是故人供禄米，初非县令给猪肝。\n养贤礼厚隆三簋，拜赐恩深艳一箪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17972,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送南禅和尚东迁灵岩","author":"陈恬","text":"万方刹境一珠辉，稽首如空无所依。\n汝浦共瞻云独往，灵岩遥伫锡东飞。\n烟霞隐现青莲峙，龙象欢呼白拂挥。\n多谢禅耆来访我，双林风月静相违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17973,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题画扇","author":"陈恬","text":"万里稻粱高兴，谁将出入君怀。\n已讶天边月上，更疑蘋末风来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17974,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈恬","text":"嵩阳读水经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17975,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈恬","text":"雪晨消磨一半春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张无梦归天台","author":"陈既济","text":"暂到京城住，辞尧返旧庐。\n身耽泉石乐，心向利名疏。\n鹤静来华表，云闲出太虚。\n钱塘应过日，秋水满红蕖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北楼","author":"陈映","text":"南涧吹云过北团，北山飞鸟入南山。\n区区云鸟缘何事，未似风流太守閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汀州","author":"陈映","text":"元丰陈汀州，见谓黄太史。\n年登境无蝗，政恐不相似。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苍玉洞","author":"蒋之奇","text":"苍玉门径阔，白云庭院深。\n鄞江一丈水，清可照人心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈显伯","text":"分明贮秋汀一角。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贽乡先生吴邦范","author":"陈显良","text":"蓬莱有乔松，特立风雨外。\n元气毓灵柯，甘露日滋溉。\n昭映旸谷霞，文章成五采。\n矫矫梁栋资，明堂不久待。\n远隔东瀛波，求之不可迈。\n清飙六合生，贞操千年在。\n终当巢鸾凤，出与圣时会。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次太白水西韵","author":"陈柄","text":"泾巘翠插天，泾溪清绕郭。\n峦环松竹里，崖磴自楼阁。\n是时秋阳骄，三日此栖泊。\n晓色林端来，晴云岩际落。\n飞梯接绝壁，画柱裹枯箨。\n谁拂梁间尘，谪仙久不作。\n予生捉月姿，方寸颇明廓。\n思君骑鲸鱼，赴我千金诺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀友","author":"陈柏","text":"携书入空山，几若与世绝。\n俯仰一室间，颇见古人别。\n良朋令人思，思君意弥切。\n食芹差自甘，那得共君啜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楚塞亭","author":"陈柏年","text":"舟行三峡乱峰间，雪浪如山毛骨寒。\n一帆喜见楚天阔，回首长吁蜀地难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其三","author":"陈某","text":"城南春深草乱飞，门前流水没渔矶。\n百年此地踏青客，今岁从军犹未归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"陈某","text":"滑滑春泥塞路途，漫漫新水涨江湖。\n出门世路皆行险，只好山林听鹧鸪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"陈某","text":"南山作雨北山云，野哭村歌处处闻。\n淮岱十年多盗贼，谁知一半是官军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日次王善夫韵","author":"陈某","text":"道路多荆棘，尘埃满客衣。\n西风九日至，往事百年非。\n王粲思何切，冯驩叹未归。\n只因江汉远，却使雁鸿稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小景","author":"陈某","text":"山迥云垂野，江空水接天。\n西风陶令宅，落日季鹰船。\n愁绪丹心外，归心白雁前。\n如何倦游客，犹是未归年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居","author":"陈某","text":"白云护危屋，遥隔世人家。\n野径不多竹，幽兰自作花。\n敝衣僧说法，枯叶树成槎。\n门外禽相狎，双双浴晚沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋客邸感怀","author":"陈某","text":"今夜天边月，谁期海上看。\n家山虽间隔，儿女暂团栾。\n露重银蟾湿，风清玉宇寒。\n年年长是客，强把一樽欢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王生小景","author":"陈某","text":"何处佳山水，依稀类辋川。\n春风摩诘画，夜月剡溪船。\n云树乡心外，莺花客泪边。\n不嫌茅屋小，应喜是归年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王宗起城南溪屋","author":"陈某","text":"水上小亭清更新，绿阴纨扇白纶巾。\n岂无修竹娱佳客，却有清风来故人。\n老树秋声凉入骨，澄江波影玉生鳞。\n读书偏爱虚窗静，不管门前庾亮尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"回回僧","author":"陈某","text":"秋风响耳环，古怪聚人看。\n赤脚行霜地，腥身礼月坛。\n儋斋犹买肉，挂帛不遮寒。\n亦有西来意，相逢欲语难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江心寺","author":"陈某","text":"谁把袈裟筑半峰，倚云楼阁打天钟。\n东西塔上自分屿，风雨声中忽见龙。\n隔岸愁吹孤戍角，归鸦寒立夕阳松。\n旧时行殿成荒土，烟草萋萋暝色重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访陈彦太不遇","author":"陈某","text":"每忆可人陈太丘，不辞山路远追游。\n清霜拂鬓鸡声早，白鹤横江月影浮。\n岂为开樽无北海，虚闻悬榻待南州。\n题诗兴尽空归去，回首梅花百尺楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宋奥寄友","author":"陈某","text":"落日犹未落，青山还自青。\n鸟飞云外见，泉过竹边听。\n童子求新汲，先生守旧扃。\n相看不相见，应注太玄经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜归","author":"陈某","text":"青松行未尽，林外一钟闻。\n小雨不伤月，西风忽破云。\n棹归秋水远，邻语夜灯分。\n稚子能无寐，空斋读古文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官舍有感","author":"陈某","text":"腊近衣方授，山深寒愈严。\n病将书卷废，愁伏酒杯添。\n故里风尘隔，微官岁月淹。\n思归归未得，低首愧陶潜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"罗浮山","author":"陈某","text":"乾坤未失鹿，沧海欲飞灰。\n人已逃时去，山犹择地来。\n寒流清有影，怪木老非梅。\n西有龙翔寺，禅门彻夜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贫居","author":"陈某","text":"秋风山木飞，秋日独行时。\n身共衣冠老，妻嫌富贵迟。\n自分浇菊水，閒写咏贫诗。\n此意不可说，夜窗明月知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泉南满归过省下呈友人","author":"陈某","text":"二月泉南驿骑回，乱离怀抱为君开。\n双凫暂假王乔力，百里空淹蒋琬才。\n省幕薇阴遮案静，溪船山色入楼来。\n应知别后遥相忆，清夜吹箫月满台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夜风雨次韵","author":"陈某","text":"独卧苦不寐，灯残知夜深。\n青毡犹是客，白发最关心。\n绕屋鸟三匝，隔江龙一吟。\n谁家催寄远，孤泪滴清砧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵仲瑜小景 其二","author":"陈某","text":"老树依岩壑，危桥隔远村。\n桃花春满岸，云气晓当门。\n白鸟来书屋，青山落酒樽。\n渔舟忽相过，疑是武陵源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵仲瑜小景 其一","author":"陈某","text":"远水望不极，断云低复连。\n青山秋树屋，野渡夕阳船。\n幽思沧洲上，归心白雁前。\n异乡非隐地，聊欲寄林泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闽峤军中","author":"陈则翁","text":"貔貅齐拥霍嫖姚，却笑青山说豹韬。\n兵马夜行残月下，弓旌寒响朔风高。\n壶浆故老愁啼血，野饭将军猛茹毛。\n自笑书生随玉帐，也腰刀剑束征袍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题九龙岩","author":"陈某","text":"里俗相传有九龙，昔年栖隐此岩中。\n烟霄一去□□隔，石户双开旧径通。\n月影日光东北近，泉声山色古今同。\n何当便脱卑凡累，来伴僧闲论苦空。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中闻歌有感","author":"陈某","text":"伏枕已三月，清明节已过。\n光阴流水去，风雨落花多。\n病久难禁酒，愁深懒听歌。\n门前舟楫动，无奈客怀何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湘灵鼓瑟","author":"陈某","text":"苍梧云杳杳，湘浦月沈沈。\n谁将竹间泪，弹成丝上音。\n如怨复如诉，可听不可寻。\n乃知二帝子，尚怀千载心。\n君臣等天地，死生空古今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"陈某","text":"禾黍离离雨满村，望中兵火几家存。\n荒城半是征人骨，秋月偏惊旅客魂。\n岂意战尘临老见，不知心事向谁论。\n抱茅盖得青山屋，多种桃花映酒樽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过田文墓","author":"陈洎","text":"当年闻奏雍门琴，话著池台泪满襟。\n何况今朝陵谷畔，池台无迹可追寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过项羽庙","author":"陈洎","text":"八千子弟已投戈，夜帐犹闻怨楚歌。\n学敌万人成底事，不思一个范增多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南齐","author":"陈洎","text":"曲江欢宴侍华裾，舞拍琴歌艺有馀。\n独有纯臣王叔宝，解陈封禅一篇书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读子虚赋","author":"陈洎","text":"听辞深怅不同时，及到同时位大卑。\n争似唐皇将颇牧，禁中言下用无疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读刘蕡策","author":"陈洎","text":"药石危言治乱箴，贾生晁错是知音。\n可怜当日司文者，不畏人言合愧心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上逢渔者","author":"陈洎","text":"雨蓑烟笠洞庭秋，独茧纶轻一叶舟。\n拟共停桡醉天幕，缓歌濯足不回头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雉媒","author":"陈洎","text":"朱冠衮背一何鲜，声厉情骄目悍然。\n若道物情皆锡类，雉媒争似鸩媒贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开元寺凌虚阁对雪寄解唐卿","author":"陈洎","text":"璚滴琳华一夜凝，凌虚雕槛晓来凭。\n眼观银色三千界，身到瑶台十二层。\n玉洒砌尘供庾斛，粉融檐水妒房陵。\n化人宫好分明在，恨不同君把袂登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"对雪寄崔仲裕","author":"陈洎","text":"夺鹤韬霞势渐浓，卷帘庭馆好支筇。\n乘查路阔寒凝冻，种玉畦平晓被封。\n天上瑶宫当月圃，海中银阙耸鳌峰。\n思君不得同吟赏，知在旗亭第几重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还刘处士先令公","author":"陈洎","text":"当年力战荡妖氛，十万雄师四七勋。\n将略妙欺班定远，家声高过李将军。\n铭图魏鼎文犹在，笔勒燕山迹尚分。\n今日闲披有遗恨，可怜生不遇明君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":18021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]